              "code": "// Date and time come from two separate calls, so a read that straddles\n// midnight can pair yesterday's date with today's time and emit a\n// timestamp a day out. Reading the date on both sides of the time and\n// retrying on a change closes that window.\nGetYearMonthDayUTC(firstYear, firstMonth, firstDay);"
            }
          },
